# Generated at build time by scripts/generate-redirects.mjs from
# lib/affiliate-links.ts. Regenerated on every build (including on the host),
# and carries a timestamp, so committing it would only produce noisy diffs
# and risk a stale redirect table shipping.
/public/_redirects
